Package: kobocheck
Title: Automated Cleaning Logs for KoboToolbox Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Jubilio", "Mausse", email = "jubiliomausse5@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads a KoboToolbox data export, its XLSForm and optional audit
    files, and produces a reviewer-ready cleaning log. Skip-logic and constraint
    checks are derived automatically from the XLSForm 'relevant' and 'constraint'
    columns. Other checks cover survey duration, duplicates and near-duplicates,
    numeric outliers, 'other' responses, choice-list consistency and
    select_multiple consistency, plus custom logical checks written in XLSForm
    syntax. Includes a Shiny app for users who do not code in R.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
